WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.662
You know that great article you saved to read later?

00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:05.700
One day, the link is just gone.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.874
WebFrost fixes that.

00:00:07.984 --> 00:00:12.653
Give it a URL, and it keeps the page in every format worth keeping:

00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:17.361
the full page, a reader view, a screenshot, even the video.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:23.746
Run it on your own machine, or deploy it to your home lab, a VPS, or the cloud.

00:00:23.746 --> 00:00:26.269
And search everything you saved.

00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:31.647
It's open source, with a live demo at demo.webfrost.dev.
